    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>gold or silver lace, gimp or braid of silk or other material, for decorative trimming (OED s.v. passement n.), here made of cruell (q.v.) | passement, strip of braiding, usually made with gold or silver wire or with silk, used as decorative trimming in interior design and fashion (OED s.v. passement n.) 261 (see also parsment) | passement, strip of braiding, usually made with gold or silver wire or with silk, used as decorative trimming in interior design and fashion (OED s.v. passement n.) 267, 269 (see also pacement) | passement, strip of braiding, usually made with gold or silver wire or with silk, used as decorative trimming in interior design and fashion (OED s.v. passement n.) 423 (see also parchement lace) | passement, strip of braiding, usually made with gold or silver wire or with silk, used as decorative trimming in interior design and fashion (OED s.v. passement n.)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
